3️⃣ Is there a formal procedure for destruction/sanitization of media and data?

Answer:
Yes. SILAC maintains a formal Media & Destruction Procedure covering secure sanitization and destruction of hard drives, magnetic tapes, CD/DVD media, and other storage. Methods include wiping, cryptographic erasure, degaussing, shredding, or crushing, depending on sensitivity and media type. Vendor-managed destruction includes certificate-of-destruction documentation where applicable.

